   "source": [
    "## Attach lognormal uncertainty to every exchange\n",
    "For lognormal (uncertainty type 2): `loc = ln(median)`, `scale = sigma` of the\n",
    "underlying normal. Setting loc = amount (not ln!) is the classic blunder."
   ]
